	(descr "0.96 inch 128x64 SSD1315/SSD1306 I2C OLED module on a 4-pin 2.54mm socket. Module outline 27.0 x 27.3 mm, header centred on one 27.0 mm edge. Pin order GND/VCC/SCL/SDA - verify against the actual module before assembly. Courtyard covers the header only: on a 2.54 mm socket the module floats about 8.5 mm above the board and overhangs whatever is underneath.")
